{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"813","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. The Contest"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Pasha is participating in a contest on one well-known website. This time he wants to win the contest and will do anything to get to the first place!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This contest consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" problems, and Pasha solves "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"th problem in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" time units (his solutions are always correct). At any moment of time he can be thinking about a solution to only one of the problems (that is, he cannot be solving two problems at the same time). The time Pasha spends to send his solutions is negligible. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Pasha can send any number of solutions at the same moment."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unfortunately, there are too many participants, and the website is not always working. Pasha received the information that the website will be working only during "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" time periods, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"th period is represented by its starting moment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lj"},{"kind":"text","text":" and ending moment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"rj"},{"kind":"text","text":". Of course, Pasha can send his solution only when the website is working. In other words, Pasha can send his solution at some moment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" iff there exists a period "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lx ≤ T ≤ rx"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Pasha wants to know his best possible result. We need to tell him the minimal moment of time by which he is able to have "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"solutions to all problems submitted"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", if he acts optimally, or say that it's impossible no matter how Pasha solves the problems."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 1000)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of problems. The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai (1 ≤ ai ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the time Pasha needs to solve "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"th problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains one integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m (0 ≤ m ≤ 1000)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of periods of time when the website is working. Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines represent these periods. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"th line contains two numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lj"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"rj (1 ≤ lj < rj ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the starting and the ending moment of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"th period."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the periods are not intersecting and are given in chronological order, so for every "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j > 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" the condition "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lj > rj - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is met."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If Pasha can solve and submit all the problems before the end of the contest, print the minimal moment of time by which he can have all the solutions submitted."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Otherwise print \"-1\" (without brackets)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n3 4\n2\n1 4\n7 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n5\n1\n1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n5\n1\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example Pasha can act like this: he solves the second problem in 4 units of time and sends it immediately. Then he spends 3 time units to solve the first problem and sends it 7 time units after the contest starts, because at this moment the website starts working again."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example Pasha invents the solution only after the website stops working for the last time."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example Pasha sends the solution exactly at the end of the first period."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"813A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/813/problem/A"}